OL,3,ATrump says 'threat' led US to pull
OL,4,Abombers from RAF Fairford
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier on Monday, a No 10 spokesperson
OL,7,Fhad insisted RAF Fairford was safe and
OL,8,Fpointed to Trump's comments last week,
OL,9,Fwhere he praised the UK's "police,
OL,10,Fdefence and security services" in
OL,11,Frelation to the base.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
