OL,3,AZelensky condemns 'horrific' Russian
OL,4,Astrike on boat carrying corn in Black
OL,5,ASea
OL,6,
OL,7,FUkraine's President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,8,Fhas condemned a "horrific" Russian
OL,9,Fattack on a vessel carrying corn in the
OL,10,FBlack Sea.
OL,12,FThe ship's captain was killed in the
OL,13,Fstrike involving two drones, Zelensky
OL,14,Fsaid, and another sailor was
OL,15,Funaccounted for. Eleven crew members -
OL,16,Fnationals of Azerbaijan and India -
OL,17,Fhave been rescued.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
