OL,4,Ato help win snap election
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut as has so often been the case
OL,7,Fthroughout Sanchez's career, the
OL,8,Fcalling of the election was not a
OL,9,Fknee-jerk reaction but a carefully
OL,10,Fthought-out manouevre.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
